        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate the integral $\\int \\frac{7}{x\\ln{\\left(5 x \\right)}}\\,\\text{d}x.$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Let's set $u=\\ln{\\left(5 x \\right)}.$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{5 x}\\cdot 5=\\frac{1}{x}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{7}{x\\ln{\\left(5 x \\right)}}\\,\\text{d}x & =7\\int \\frac{1}{\\ln{\\left(5 x \\right)}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =7\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =7\\ln|u|+C \\\\  & =7\\ln|\\ln{\\left(5 x \\right)}|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        ":question/answer-fields": [
